ndry operations, and provides installation, maintenance, and repair services to government, institutional, industrial, commercial, and retail customers. It has operations in the United States, Canada, the Caribbean, and Latin America. The company was formerly known as EnviroStar, Inc. and changed its name to EVI Industries, Inc. in December 2018. EVI Industries, Inc. was founded in 1959 and is based in Miami, Florida."}}